WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.206 --> 00:00:02.580
(comical music)

00:00:02.580 --> 00:00:04.560
Well, it's time to share
some home-cooked pasta

00:00:04.560 --> 00:00:06.741
with someone I don't get
to see enough these days,

00:00:06.741 --> 00:00:08.780
Andy Richter.

00:00:08.780 --> 00:00:10.730
Hey Conan, Thanks for having me over.

00:00:11.590 --> 00:00:13.610
I'm super excited to have you here,

00:00:13.610 --> 00:00:15.610
sitting at the same table.

00:00:15.610 --> 00:00:18.120
'Cause today, I've made one
of the most labor-intensive,

00:00:18.120 --> 00:00:21.773
but rewarding pasta
dishes ever, the timpano.

00:00:22.780 --> 00:00:26.720
Wait, is that the pasta dish
from the movie "Big Night?"

00:00:26.720 --> 00:00:27.560
That's right.

00:00:27.560 --> 00:00:31.160
It's a massive pasta drum,
stuffed with Genoa salami,

00:00:31.160 --> 00:00:32.610
meatballs, eggs and cheese,

00:00:32.610 --> 00:00:37.610
and topped with thick,
delicious Prego pasta sauce!

00:00:37.780 --> 00:00:40.530
Yes, it took me three days to make it!

00:00:40.530 --> 00:00:41.740
Wait, wait, wait.

00:00:41.740 --> 00:00:44.670
Did you say Prego pasta sauce?

00:00:44.670 --> 00:00:48.160
Yes, so this timpano must
weigh about six pounds.

00:00:48.160 --> 00:00:49.230
It's such a thick sauce.

00:00:49.230 --> 00:00:50.560
Lemme just lift it up and show you.

00:00:50.560 --> 00:00:52.470
You're going to love seeing--

00:00:52.470 --> 00:00:53.610
No, no, no, no, don't bother.

00:00:53.610 --> 00:00:56.350
Just, you know, just slide
me over that jar of Prego

00:00:56.350 --> 00:00:58.010
and I'll just drink it
straight from the jar.

00:00:58.010 --> 00:00:59.113
That's plenty for me.

00:01:00.430 --> 00:01:01.380
Sure.

00:01:01.380 --> 00:01:03.620
I mean, this did take
me a long time to make.

00:01:03.620 --> 00:01:06.760
Nah, I'll be good with
just the jar of Prego.

00:01:06.760 --> 00:01:08.803
Oh, just the Prego, okay.

00:01:10.480 --> 00:01:11.783
Here you go, ol' pal.

00:01:13.620 --> 00:01:15.287
Ah, thank you.

00:01:15.287 --> 00:01:17.660
Oh, could I get a straw too, please?

00:01:17.660 --> 00:01:20.291
Yeah, I happen to have a
giant straw right here.

00:01:20.291 --> 00:01:22.958
(slide whistle whoops)

00:01:22.958 --> 00:01:27.958
(sighs) Oh man, let's do this!

00:01:28.060 --> 00:01:28.893
Okay, Andy.
(Andy slurping)

00:01:28.893 --> 00:01:30.970
You're sure you don't
want to try my timpano.

00:01:30.970 --> 00:01:32.260
It's right here.

00:01:32.260 --> 00:01:33.207
You can literally just lift it up.

00:01:33.207 --> 00:01:35.260
Oh, that is so good.

00:01:35.260 --> 00:01:36.760
I just felt a chunk of tomato

00:01:36.760 --> 00:01:38.910
tickling my uvula going.

00:01:38.910 --> 00:01:40.880
Thank you so much.

00:01:40.880 --> 00:01:43.070
Hey, Prego!

00:01:43.070 --> 00:01:45.700
Yeah, no duh, I can read the label.

00:01:45.700 --> 00:01:48.980
No, Andy, Prego is Italian
for you're welcome.

00:01:48.980 --> 00:01:50.540
Oh, okay.

00:01:50.540 --> 00:01:51.580
Oh my God!

00:01:51.580 --> 00:01:53.393
A squirrel is eating my timpano!

00:01:54.800 --> 00:01:57.083
[Announcer] Prego, It
means you're welcome.

